      "inputTokens": 126,
      "outputTokens": 925,
      "costUsd": 0.008388000000000001,
      "pronunciationText": "Now the totals. From last video, S sub n is a, times one minus r to the n, over one minus r. Split that into two parts. It's a over one minus r, minus a over one minus r, times r to the n. For our series, a over one minus r is one hundred and twenty-eight, and the second part is the gap that's left. As n grows, r to the n shrinks towards zero, so the gap shrinks towards zero too. The totals get as close to one hundred and twenty-eight as you like, without ever passing it."
    },
