      "possibleRetry": false,
      "inputTokens": 50,
      "outputTokens": 393,
      "costUsd": 0.003562,
      "pronunciationText": "Here's a way to remember the condition. When the size of r is less than one, the terms shrink, so the total settles. Shrinking ratio, settling sum. And the value it settles on is a over one minus r."
